request: Add a button that clears every movie whose `seen` flag is true from the watchlist.

governor turn 1: plan -> watchlist-store, watchlist  (The request's "seen" flag maps to WatchItem.watched (the only such flag in the model). The store owns list state and persistence, so it gains clearWatched(); the watchlist page gains a "Clear watched" button that delegates to it. Additive change — other WatchlistStore importers (movie-detail, search) are unaffected.)
round 1: owners watchlist-store=ok watchlist=ok; oracle RED
governor turn 2 failed: prompt of ~6195 tokens exceeds the 6000-token budget

